DTSTART:20260919T100000
DTEND:20260919T160000
DTSTAMP:20260919T143151Z
UID:c61938b36b4f31a7cda12ce1d0bbac@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Milton Artists' Guild is excited to announce the 2026 Art & St
 roll Festival on Saturday\, September 19! An annual tradition\, Art & Stro
 ll is an outdoor art fair that brings the community together for a great d
 ay of art\, food\, music\, and fun! Located on the grass lot between the M
 ilton Hannaford and Aubuchon in the Milton Shopping Plaza on Route-7 South
 \, from 10am-4pm we'll be outside celebrating with dozens of artists\, art
 isans\, and craft vendors\, food trucks and take-out caterers\, live music
  from several local musical artists\, activities for kids\, and more--rain
  or shine! Admission is FREE but we always appreciate a donation to suppor
 t MAG's mission in making art accessible for all. Milton Shopping Center\n
 \nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Vermont Public is independent\, community-supported media\, servi
 ng Vermont with trusted\, relevant and essential information. We share sto
 ries that bring people together\, from every corner of our region.\, © 20
 26 Vermont Public | 365 Troy Ave. Colchester\, VT 05446
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/2026-art-s
 troll-festival-in-milton-28-08-2026-08-35-21
END:VEVENT
