 mal Repair Hospital\, food vendors\, and artisan booths. The museum will h
 ost a first-floor open house featuring Rugs: Fiber Art Under Foot. This ex
 hibit will also include a special showcase of master rug hookers demonstra
 ting their craft. In the Twilight House parlor\, visitors can explore the 
 Vermont Schoolgirl Sampler Exhibit. 109 Old Stone House Rd. Brownington \,
  Vermont 05819 9802)754-2022 outreach@oldstonehousemuseum.org www.oldstone
