BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ACORN's Tour de Farms
DTSTART:20260919T083000
DTEND:20260919T143000
DTSTAMP:20260919T143151Z
UID:68c6253ce76759b65866bfd57ac01e@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Come Ride and Enjoy the Best of Vermont! Come enjoy the best t
 hat Vermont has to offer - from glorious scenery to delicious samples of f
 oods that are produced here in the Champlain Valley. Our 37-mile ride and 
 11-mile family-friendly ride have farm stops along the way. Meet the wonde
 rful people who produce the food and goods that nourish our community. Thi
 s ride is ACORN's largest fundraiser of the year and benefits the ACORN Fo
 od Hub and its Farmacy: Food is Medicine programs\, both of which strength
 en food security and farm viability. 100% of the proceeds from the Tour fu
 nds ACORN's work and directly supports our foodshed. 150\n\nSources: Vermo
 nt Public
LOCATION:ACORN\, 201 Mary Hogan Dr
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/acorns-tou
 r-de-farms-28-07-2026-15-27-59
