BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adirondack Harvest Festival
DTSTART:20260919T120000
DTEND:20260919T170000
DTSTAMP:20260919T143151Z
UID:9987e5459646d066d5129ff467f2db@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:The 10th Annual Adirondack Harvest Festival will take place on
  Saturday\, September 19\, 2026 from 12 to 5 PM at the Essex County Fairgr
 ounds in Westport\, NY. The theme of the hands-on workshops and demonstrat
 ions will be “Bees & Honey” with experts leading workshops on making m
 ead\, cooking with honey\, making DIY skincare and dipped beeswax candles
 \; demonstrations on beekeeping and weaving with wool\; and a beginner’s
  lecture on beekeeping. The event will also feature a large farmers’ mar
 ket\, local food trucks\, “Local Libations” tent\, live music\, kids
 ’ activities\, horse wagon and pony rides\, contests\, a petting zoo\, a
 nd much more. Free admission and parking\, with many free and low-cost act
 ivities. This festival is an event of Cornell Cooperative Extension of Ess
 ex County’s flagship Adirondack Harvest Program. For more information vi
 sit https://adirondackharvest.com/festival/. If you’d like to donate to 
 the festival to keep it free to attend\, please visit https://adirondackha
 rvest.com/adirondack-harvest-friends/.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Essex County Fairgrounds\, 3 Sisco St
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/adirondack
 -harvest-festival-27-08-2026-15-42-49
END:VEVENT
